---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Gear store"
  description="ANU Mountaineering Club gear store: opening hours, hire rates and what's in stock."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Gear store</h1>
    <p>
      Members can hire climbing, hiking and mountaineering gear at rates well
      below retail hire shops. No booking needed &mdash; just come by during
      opening hours with your membership card.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="hours-heading">
    <h2 id="hours-heading">Location &amp; opening hours</h2>
    <dl class="spec-list">
      <dt>Location</dt>
      <dd>
        ANU Sport building (David Cocking Sport and Recreation Centre) &mdash;
        through the far sports hall, up the stairs, in Storeroom 4. Ask at the
        climbing wall if you can't find it. Not wheelchair accessible.
      </dd>
      <dt>Tuesdays</dt>
      <dd>5:30pm &ndash; 7pm</dd>
      <dt>Thursdays</dt>
      <dd>5:30pm &ndash; 7pm</dd>
      <dt>Trip weekends</dt>
      <dd>Gear for a booked trip can be collected the Friday before, by arrangement with the trip leader.</dd>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="rates-heading">
    <h2 id="rates-heading">Hire rates (per weekend)</h2>
    <div class="trip-table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Item</th>
            <th scope="col">Member rate</th>
            <th scope="col">Non-member rate</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Climbing harness</th>
            <td>$5</td>
            <td>$12</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Helmet</th>
            <td>$3</td>
            <td>$8</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">70L hiking pack</th>
            <td>$8</td>
            <td>$18</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">4-season tent (2-person)</th>
            <td>$12</td>
            <td>$25</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Ice axe &amp; crampons (pair)</th>
            <td>$10</td>
            <td>$22</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>
      Non-members can hire gear once, for a first trip, at the non-member
      rate &mdash; after that, join up.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="stock-heading">
    <h2 id="stock-heading">What's usually in stock</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Climbing</h3>
        <p>Harnesses, helmets, quickdraws, belay devices, ropes up to 60m.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Hiking</h3>
        <p>Packs from 35L&ndash;70L, sleeping bags and mats, trekking poles.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3>Mountaineering</h3>
        <p>Ice axes, crampons, 4-season tents, avalanche transceivers.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p>
      Stock is limited and first-come, first-served &mdash; for a trip that
      needs specific gear, ask the trip leader ahead of time rather than
      relying on the store having it that week.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
